        "image": "shopify://shop_images/hokk-founder.jpg",
        "heading": "Note From Founder",
        "paragraph_1": "Every dream begins with a thought, and House of Kala Katha began with mine — a desire to celebrate the beauty of Indian handlooms and bring their stories closer to today's world.\nHouse of Kala Katha was born from my love for the beauty of Indian handlooms and the stories woven into every fabric.\n\nI've always been drawn to the richness of our textiles, the beauty of traditional weaves, and the little details that make each creation special. To me, handloom is not just about what we wear; it's about the stories, traditions and craftsmanship carried through generations.",
